Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.88,0:00:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,《The Day you went away》\NM2M
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.13,0:00:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh-Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.60,0:00:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wo-wo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.24,0:00:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Well I wonder\N♪ 我在想 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.39,0:00:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,could it be?\N♪ 这可能吗？ ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.36,0:00:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,When I was dreaming about you baby\N♪ 当我梦见你的时候，宝贝 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.66,0:00:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You were dreaming of me\N♪ 你也在梦见我 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.60,0:00:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Call me crazy\N♪ 说我疯狂吧 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.33,0:00:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Call me blind\N♪ 说我盲目吧 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.73,0:00:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,To still be suffering is stupid after all of this time\N♪ 过了这么久还在痛苦，真是太傻了 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.16,0:00:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I lose my love to someone better?\N♪ 我的爱是否输给了一个更好的人？ ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.79,0:00:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And does she love you like I do?\N♪ 她会像我一样爱你吗？ ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.25,0:00:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I do, you know I really really do\N♪ 我会的，你知道我是真的真的爱你 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.28,0:00:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well hey, so much I need to say\N♪ 嘿，我有太多话要说 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.62,0:00:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Been lonely since the day\N♪ 从那天起我就一直孤单 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.03,0:01:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The day you went away\N♪ 你离开的那天 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.80,0:01:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So sad but true\N♪ 如此悲伤却又如此真实 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.81,0:01:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,For me there's only you\N♪ 对我来说只有你 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.80,0:01:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Been crying since the day\N♪ 从那天起我就一直在哭泣 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.71,0:01:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The day you went away\N♪ 你离开的那天 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.18,0:01:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh-Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.86,0:01:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh-Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.86,0:01:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember date and time\N♪ 我清楚地记得日期和时间 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.19,0:01:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,September twenty second\N♪ 那天是九月二十二日 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.24,0:01:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sunday twenty five after nine\N♪ 周日，九点二十五分 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.49,0:01:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,In the doorway with your case\N♪ 你提着箱子站在门口 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.66,0:01:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No longer shouting at each other\N♪ 我们不再互相争吵 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.61,0:01:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,There were tears on our faces\N♪ 我们脸上都有泪水 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.57,0:01:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And we were letting go of something special\N♪ 我们放下了一些特别的东西 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.02,0:01:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Something we'll never have again\N♪ 一些我们再也不会拥有的东西 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.51,0:01:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, I guess I really really know\N♪ 我知道，我想我真的真的知道 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.42,0:01:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Well hey, so much I need to say\N♪ 嘿，我有太多话要说 ♪
