Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.80,0:03:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do we never know what we've got till it's gone?\N♪ 为什么直到失去我们才懂得珍惜？ ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.98,0:03:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How could i carry on?\N♪ 我该如何继续？ ♪
